msgid "Cards, checklists and labels"
msgstr ""

msgid "Todo"
msgstr ""

msgid "Planned contents:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Creating a card, and what the card face shows: labels, dates, checklist "
"progress, people."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The card dialog and each of its fields: name, description, start, due and"
" end dates, labels, people, checklists."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"How the due-date colour changes: green with more than ten days to go, "
"through yellow and orange, red on the day, dark red once it has passed. "
"The card's own colour, chosen per user from the card menu."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"People on a card: the creator, members and assignees — what the "
"distinction means, and that only assignees get due-date reminders."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Labels: creating, editing, deleting and reordering them per board (the "
"board menu's \"Labels\"), then attaching them to cards."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Checklists and their items: adding, ticking, reordering both checklists "
"and items by drag and drop, deleting."
msgstr ""

msgid "Copying a checklist to another card, on this board or another one."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Extracting a checklist item into a card of its own: what the new card "
"inherits from its parent (labels, dates, people, colour) and what it "
"doesn't (description, checklists), the parent card's name in the new "
"card, and that the original item stays put."
msgstr ""

msgid "Moving a card within a list and between lists by drag and drop."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Copying a card, to any list of any board you can see: what the copy "
"keeps, and how labels and people are matched on the target board."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Archiving a card, and restoring it from the \"Archived Lists & Cards\" "
"view."
msgstr ""

